1
00:00:03,262 --> 00:00:06,178
Open Interaction Center, Call recordings.

2
00:00:06,178 --> 00:00:11,327
The page says that no recorded call matches until a recording has been saved.

3
00:00:11,327 --> 00:00:14,802
Calls are listed here once their recording exists.

4
00:00:15,327 --> 00:00:19,824
Started is the date range to search, such as Today, Last 7 days

5
00:00:19,824 --> 00:00:22,887
or a custom range, in your own time zone.

6
00:00:23,393 --> 00:00:26,993
Phone number matches all or part of the customer's number.

7
00:00:27,734 --> 00:00:30,246
Direction is Inbound or Outbound.

8
00:00:30,246 --> 00:00:33,079
Call type is Contact Center call, A.I.

9
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:35,654
voice agent, or Soft phone keypad.

10
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:40,462
Agent picks whose calls to list, from the Contact Center agents.

11
00:00:40,462 --> 00:00:44,305
It is shown only to users who may hear everyone's calls.

12
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:48,379
Click Filter to search, or Clear to start again.

13
00:00:48,379 --> 00:00:54,018
When calls match, each row shows the customer's number, the direction, the call

14
00:00:54,018 --> 00:00:57,997
type, when the call started, the agent and the length.

